# Format: RULE/name:path/glob # reason

# WHY: cargo deny runs in the dedicated .github/workflows/security.yml
# (EmbarkStudios/cargo-deny-action, check advisories licenses bans sources),
# not in ci.yml -- the fleet SUPPLY-CHAIN.md pattern keeps dependency audit in
# its own workflow (PR + daily schedule) rather than duplicating it inside the
# build/test workflow. CI/no-deny-check only reads .github/workflows/ci.yml
# and cannot see the sibling security.yml, so it false-fires on every repo
# that follows this pattern. Rule fix tracked: forkwright/kanon#2975.
CI/no-deny-check:.github/workflows/ci.yml
